        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3937000/extras/2c19091d16bb4a393984a72da3288a5c.poster.avif?t=1772652682\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3937000/extras/2c19091d16bb4a393984a72da3288a5c.webm?t=1772652682\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3937000/extras/2c19091d16bb4a393984a72da3288a5c.mp4?t=1772652682\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Become <i>Meep</i>, the bouncy digital USB-mouse, and fix outdated equipment the only way you know how: More <i>RAM</i>! Follow your calling and embark on a quest to collect enough RAM and repair a  broken toaster!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3937000/extras/1e05805a67885ecec334aeb61ff881e8.poster.avif?t=1772652682\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3937000/extras/1e05805a67885ecec334aeb61ff881e8.webm?t=1772652682\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3937000/extras/1e05805a67885ecec334aeb61ff881e8.mp4?t=1772652682\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To download RAM, you will have to enter and traverse cyberspace. Cyberspace is, of course, all blocks and pixels... Can you clear all levels and unlock each new gigabyte of RAM?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3937000/extras/c16e7adbe9e9e2844c8cd605912b9b2b.poster.avif?t=1772652682\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3937000/extras/c16e7adbe9e9e2844c8cd605912b9b2b.webm?t=1772652682\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3937000/extras/c16e7adbe9e9e2844c8cd605912b9b2b.mp4?t=1772652682\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i>Stack Prootocol</i> is a cute, little puzzle platformer in which you will...</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jump!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Slide!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Move and Rotate Blocks!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beat your personal best times!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Meep!&quot;</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3937000/extras/09e51d4c02ed2b508a6386b5913baf4a.poster.avif?t=1772652682\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3937000/extras/09e51d4c02ed2b508a6386b5913baf4a.webm?t=1772652682\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3937000/extras/09e51d4c02ed2b508a6386b5913baf4a.mp4?t=1772652682\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Bounce and puzzle your way through <strong>40+</strong> levels!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each level has an intended solution that is quick to execute, once you <i>have</i> found it; but often  there are multiple ways to reach the same goal—find your very own!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Test your dexterity, problem solving and platforming skills. Can you beat the extra challenging bonus levels?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3937000/extras/4b8d09dd7fb5e84a8719105fac476703.poster.avif?t=1772652682\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3937000/extras/4b8d09dd7fb5e84a8719105fac476703.webm?t=1772652682\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3937000/extras/4b8d09dd7fb5e84a8719105fac476703.mp4?t=1772652682\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3937000/extras/facf312df1f3763de8b9747d0e48c575.poster.avif?t=1772652682\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3937000/extras/facf312df1f3763de8b9747d0e48c575.webm?t=1772652682\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3937000/extras/facf312df1f3763de8b9747d0e48c575.mp4?t=1772652682\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
